{"seq":2,"slug":"design-principles","title":"建筑设计原理","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/engineering/architecture/design-principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"space-and-function","title":"大学建筑学 — 空间与功能","url":"/education/university/engineering/architecture/design-principles/space-and-function","wordCount":1385,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"form-and-composition","title":"大学建筑学 — 形式与构图美学","url":"/education/university/engineering/architecture/design-principles/form-and-composition","wordCount":1499,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"design-method-and-process","title":"设计方法与流程","url":"/education/university/engineering/architecture/design-principles/design-method-and-process","wordCount":1662,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 建筑设计原理\n\n如果说历史告诉你建筑\"曾经是什么\"，那么设计原理回答的是\"如何创造新建筑\"。本章讲解建筑师日常工作的核心语言：如何组织空间序列、如何用比例与构图让形式悦目、如何把模糊的需求一步步推进成可建造的方案。\n\n本章分三课。第一课讲空间与功能——平面如何回应人的行为与流线；第二课讲形式与构图美学——比例、尺度、虚实这些让建筑\"好看\"的底层规律；第三课讲设计方法与流程，揭示从场地调研到方案深化的真实工作路径。\n"}